CHAPTER.VERS:
The Spirit of the Lord is upon me, because he has anointed me; he has sent 

          Lu 4:18
         me to preach glad tidings to the poor, to heal the broken in heart, to proclaim liberty to the captives, and recovery of sight to the blind;

And their seed shall be known among the Gentiles, and their offspring in the midst of peoples: every one that sees them shall 

          Or, acknowledge
         take notice of them, that they are a seed blessed of God;
